# Build-time tooling that lives in the deploy directory but must never be
# served. Both of these were publicly fetchable on winsvpn.org before this
# file existed (HTTP 200 on /wrangler.jsonc and /update_style_csp.py).
#
# Nothing here is a secret -- the rate-limiter namespace_ids in wrangler.jsonc
# are placeholders -- but the config names internal endpoints and states the
# per-minute limits on the payment and translate routes, which is free
# reconnaissance for anyone probing them.
#
# Files beginning with a dot (including this one and every macOS ._ AppleDouble
# file) are already excluded by Cloudflare Pages, so they need no entry.
wrangler.jsonc
update_style_csp.py
verify_inline_csp.py
winn3-dev-override.ini
winn3-dev-override.json
i18n/major.json
__pycache__/
# Local-only download custody records: read by the gates, never public.
releases/owner-publication-evidence.json
releases/download-custody-challenge.json
releases/download-custody-consumed.jsonl
releases/README.md

# Downloads remain excluded until exact current signed artifacts and every
# required receipt are bound by web/releases/downloads.json and pass the public
# download custody gates. This is a custody control, not a file-size claim.
# The Worker also reads the deployed manifest and refuses every unbound path.
downloads/
